# SaveLoom core

Personal finance app: Next.js 15, Prisma/Postgres, NextAuth (Google), Plaid, Claude.

**Local dev:** `docker start SaveLoom-postgres` then `npm run dev` (port 3000). DB required for auth.

**Branch:** `feature/unified-theme`. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/saveloom/SKILL.md` in new chats.

**Money:** Use `~/lib/money` (`parseMoney`, `formatCurrency`). Dashboard stats from `GET /api/dashboard/stats` only.

**UI:** Tokens from `~/lib/design`. Lucide icons. Modals via `useAppModal()`. No emojis.

**Never commit:** `.env`, `.env.local`. Only commit when user asks.
